            "description": "",
            "summary": "On July 26, 2024, SIT Investment Associates Inc made a significant addition to its portfolio by acquiring 1,982,368 shares of Gabelli Multimedia Trust Inc (NYSE:GGT).  The trade had a 0.22% impact on the firm's portfolio, increasing its total holdings in GGT to the same number of shares, which now constitute 0.23% of its portfolio and 5.98% of GGT's outstanding shares.  The firm's portfolio is heavily skewed towards the financial services and technology sectors, reflecting a strategic focus on high-growth areas.",
